{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#522","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#522","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#522\",\"parent_revision\":\"9a525a825c37cd16843c92b7ed5e83e56eb198452610eb3e5732b6629141b59b\",\"root_revision\":\"9a525a825c37cd16843c92b7ed5e83e56eb198452610eb3e5732b6629141b59b\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Chore\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nInterview the user with 5 mission statement questions to draft and refine `plugins/agent-orchestration/mission.json`.\\n\\nRun: `/plugin-creator:mission-statement plugins/agent-orchestration --interview`\\n\\n**Q1 \u2014 Non-Negotiable:** \\\"What is the one thing this plugin must never sacrifice, even to ship faster?\\\"\\n\\n**Q2 \u2014 Bad Twin:** \\\"What would a superficially similar but wrong version of this plugin do? What makes it wrong?\\\"\\n\\n**Q3 \u2014 Trade-offs:** \\\"When forced to choose between breadth vs depth / correctness vs speed / explicit vs implicit \u2014 which does this plugin choose, and why?\\\" (Ask all three. If \\\"both\\\", ask \\\"if you could only have one.\\\")\\n\\n**Q4 \u2014 Removal Trigger:** \\\"What would make you remove this plugin from the marketplace entirely?\\\"\\n\\n**Q5 \u2014 Anti-Pattern Example:** \\\"Give me a specific example of a fix or improvement this plugin should refuse to make, even if asked.\\\"\\n\\nAfter interview: update `mission.json` with answers, set `interview_backlog_item` to this issue number, validate with 3 known past decisions.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAssessment date: 2026-04-23\\n\\n| # | Condition | Status | Source |\\n|---|-----------|--------|--------|\\n| 1 | Q1 \u2014 Non-negotiable answer | MISSING \u2014 requires live user input |\\n| 2 | Q2 \u2014 Bad twin description | MISSING \u2014 requires live user input |\\n| 3 | Q3 \u2014 Trade-off preferences (3 axes) | MISSING \u2014 requires live user input |\\n| 4 | Q4 \u2014 Removal trigger | MISSING \u2014 requires live user input |\\n| 5 | Q5 \u2014 Anti-pattern example | MISSING \u2014 requires live user input |\\n| 6 | `plugins/agent-orchestration/mission.json` may not exist yet | DERIVABLE \u2014 check file system |\\n\\nVerdict: BLOCKED \u2014 Q1\u2013Q5 answers are MISSING. User must be present to conduct the interview interactively.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\nP2 Chore. Single file created/updated. Zero risk. Captures plugin identity to guide future development decisions. Blocked on user availability for interactive interview.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] User interviewed with Q1\u2013Q5 (non-negotiable, bad twin, trade-offs, removal trigger, anti-pattern example)\\n- [ ] `plugins/agent-orchestration/mission.json` created or updated with answers\\n- [ ] `interview_backlog_item` field in `mission.json` set to `522`\\n- [ ] Mission validated against 3 known past decisions for the plugin\\n- [ ] Run: `/plugin-creator:mission-statement plugins/agent-orchestration --interview`\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/agent-orchestration/mission.json` \u2014 create or update with interview answers\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs the plugin author of `agent-orchestration`, I need to answer 5 mission statement questions so that `plugins/agent-orchestration/mission.json` captures the non-negotiable values, anti-patterns, and trade-off decisions that define the plugin's identity.\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **mission interview: agent-orchestration** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Mission statement development process\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-07\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"a892dba9a2dbb4f6b87f5462f2de63cf2f1095db341f387033ddb34fe97c09a3\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPTC4xw\"}"}